# No environment variables are required yet — v1 is a static/informational
# site with no backend, database, or auth. This file exists so the pattern
# is established before the first one is actually needed (e.g. an email
# provider key for the Contact/Careers form, added when that feature ships).
#
# Client-exposure rule (Next.js): only variables prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ are
# inlined into the browser bundle and are NOT secret. Anything without that
# prefix stays server-only. Never prefix a real secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
